      <title>42000美元泳池升级被转给已拒分包商，业主如何用合同堵死层层转包</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/42000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%B3%B3%E6%B1%A0%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E8%A2%AB%E8%BD%AC%E7%BB%99%E5%B7%B2%E6%8B%92%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E4%B8%BB%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%94%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%A0%B5%E6%AD%BB%E5%B1%82%E5%B1%82%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%85/</link>
